# Split Massive Route Files into Sub-Modules

Split each blueprint's monolithic `routes.py` into logically grouped sub-files within a `routes/` package. All URL endpoints remain unchanged — only file organization changes.

## Strategy

Each module's `routes.py` becomes `routes/__init__.py` (which imports sub-modules). Each sub-file imports `bp` from the parent blueprint and registers its own routes. **Zero URL changes, zero template changes, zero frontend impact.**

